  "slug": "make-the-loss-cute",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2361_make-the-loss-cute.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A man bought a new pair of shoes that he liked very much, so he wore them on the train to visit his girlfriend. But during the ride, one of his shoes fell off the train. Everyone thought it was a shame, but he immediately threw the other shoe off too. Everyone was puzzled. The man said, “One shoe is no use to me now, but if someone finds the pair, they might be able to wear them!”"
  ],
  "english_full": "A man bought a new pair of shoes that he liked very much, so he wore them on the train to visit his girlfriend. But during the ride, one of his shoes fell off the train. Everyone thought it was a shame, but he immediately threw the other shoe off too. Everyone was puzzled. The man said, “One shoe is no use to me now, but if someone finds the pair, they might be able to wear them!”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "О́дин дя́дя купи́л но́вую па́ру ту́фель, которые́ ему́ о́чень по́нрави́лись, поэ́тому он надел их в пое́зде, чтобы навести́ свою́ гёрлфренд. Но во вре́мя езды́ о́дна из ту́фель упа́ла с поезда. Все ду́мали, что это́ позо́р, но он неме́дленно вы́бросил и вту́р ту́флю. Все были озада́чены. Дя́дя ска́зал: «О́дна ту́фля мне не по́льза, но если кто́-то найде́т па́ру, они́ смогут их поноси́ть!»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ódin dyádya kupíl nóvuyu páru túfel', kotorýe emú óchen' pónravilis', póetomu on nadel ikh v pojézde, chtoby navestí svóyu gyórlfren'd. No vo vremya yezdý ódna iz túfel' upála s pojezda. Vse dúmali, chto etá pozó r, no on nemé́dlenno výbrosil i vtúr túfl'yu. Vse byli ozádacheny. Dyádya skázal: «Ódna túfl'ya mne ne pól'za, no esli któ-to naydét páru, oní smógnut ikh ponosít'!»"
  ],
